E('wonders of the modern world|new seven wonders', 'The New Seven Wonders of the World were chosen by a worldwide public vote.', 'The results were announced in 2007.', 'They are the Great Wall of China, Petra, Christ the Redeemer, Machu Picchu, Chichén Itzá, the Colosseum and the Taj Mahal.', 'The Great Pyramid was given honorary status.', 'Over 100 million votes were reportedly cast.')
E('chichen itza', 'Chichén Itzá is a large Maya city in Mexico’s Yucatán Peninsula.', 'It flourished from about AD 600 to 1200.', 'Its step pyramid, El Castillo, has 365 steps in total.', 'At the equinoxes, shadows look like a serpent sliding down the stairs.', 'It is one of the New Seven Wonders.')
E('tikal', 'Tikal was one of the largest cities of the Maya.', 'It flourished from about 200 to 900 AD, in modern Guatemala.', 'Its temples rise above the jungle canopy.', 'It may have had over 50,000 people.', 'It was abandoned in the 10th century.')
